# Ecom-sites — repo-root ignore rules (apply to every site folder)

# Secrets — never commit, in any site subfolder
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/config.yml

# Local tooling / generated output — not part of any theme
**/preview/_tools/
**/preview/generated/
**/.shopify/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
